{"id":"wb-5-35","name":"奥里米城址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"奥里米城址","text":"奥里米城址或称奥里米古城，位于黑龙江省鹤岗市绥滨县。此处遗址是辽、金时代的五国部之奥里米国的部落城堡，即酋帅驻地。属于胡里改路（相当于省级机构）。\n2001年，中国国务院公布中兴城址为第五批全国重点文物保护单位（古遗址）。\n另有两座姊妹城，一个是中兴古城（即中兴城址，在绥滨县忠仁镇），一个是蜿蜒河古城（今蜿蜒河汇入黑龙江入口处）。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A5%A5%E9%87%8C%E7%B1%B3%E5%9F%8E%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95376750,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95376750","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e700dbbbb753e7c8af4e6eb2.jpg","title":"双鹿纹玉佩.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%8C%E9%B9%BF%E7%BA%B9%E7%8E%89%E4%BD%A9.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/%E5%8F%8C%E9%B9%BF%E7%BA%B9%E7%8E%89%E4%BD%A9.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huanokinhejo","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​双鹿纹玉佩 金 绥滨县奥里米金墓出土。和田白玉雕成，左侧公鹿引颈而鸣，右侧母鹿回望。两鹿上方有一大雁","width":320,"height":201}}